# Copy to ~/.claude/booharness-secrets.env (chmod 600). KEY=value lines, no quotes.
# The file name is fixed in the harness code (ops/bootstrap/install-harness.mjs,
# ops/bootstrap/jev-client.mjs). Every key here is OPTIONAL: leave a line out and
# the feature it feeds stays off, labelled as unavailable.

# Jev, the small judge model orch asks for report grading, brief scope, drift and
# review depth (https://api.typesafe.ai). Without it orch labels those answers
# "Jev unavailable" and uses the fixed floor (one reviewer, no scope gate).
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Bright Data web MCP (search and scrape for lead and researcher seats).
# Needs `npm ci --prefix ops/mcp-vendor` as well. Without it the server is skipped.
# BRIGHTDATA_API_KEY=
